==Location and Uses==
==={{BotW|-}}===
Red Lizalfos Tails are [[Monster Part]]s that are dropped by [[Fire-Breath Lizalfos]] upon their deaths. Fire-Breath Lizalfos can be found in the [[Gerudo Desert]] and the region of [[Eldin (Region)|Eldin]]. Their flavor makes them unsuitable for consumption, but they can be combined with critters in a [[Cooking Pot]] to make Elixirs.<ref name="BotW Inventory"/> [[Kilton]] at the [[Fang and Bone]] accepts Red Lizalfos Tails in exchange for [[Mon]], but they can also be used at the [[Kochi Dye Shop]] to make [[Red Dye]].

Ten Red Lizalfos Tails, as well as five [[Ruby|Rubies]], are needed to upgrade each piece of the [[Snowquill Set]] to their final tiers at a [[Great Fairy Fountain]].
